{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoner\u2019s Tale is an Action RPG that redefines monster-taming with new, immersive way. Play a young summoner on a perilous journey to uncover hidden truths and restore balance. Befriend and command powerful monsters, harness their unique abilities, and forge unbreakable bonds as you build your ultimate squad. Battle through a world on the brink, where every encounter shapes your destiny!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Tale of Betrayal and Redemption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters and men, bound by destiny and divided by war. In a world where loyalty is tested and legends are rewritten, one journey will determine the fate of all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash powerful monsters, each with a unique ability! Monsters are divided into four classes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Companions:</strong> Follow and fight beside you until their energy runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attackers:</strong> Appear briefly to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supporters:</strong> Provide instant support with special skills, then vanish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enhancers:</strong> Give you new mobility options and special enhancements to conquer your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/Monster_Types2.gif?t=1744017852\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tame Monsters In Many Ways</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monster taming is more dynamic than ever! Battle fierce challengers, race speedy rivals, gather rare items, or complete unique tasks to recruit new allies.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle alongside your monsters, level them up, and unlock their true potential as they evolve into even more powerful forms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/extras/Summoner_Evolve2_Cut.gif?t=1744017852\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay updated on Summoner\u2019s Tale! Fresh content, progress insights, and weekly sneak peeks shared on X @Negm_World. Follow along and join the journey! \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2081350?t=1744017852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744017852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744017852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744017852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoner\u2019s Tale is an Action RPG that redefines monster-taming with new, immersive way. Play a young summoner on a perilous journey to uncover hidden truths and restore balance. Befriend and command powerful monsters, harness their unique abilities, and forge unbreakable bonds as you build your ultimate squad. Battle through a world on the brink, where every encounter shapes your destiny!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Tale of Betrayal and Redemption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters and men, bound by destiny and divided by war. In a world where loyalty is tested and legends are rewritten, one journey will determine the fate of all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><stron